    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni Daudini ammalle worra Filisti had'e dabsate, dira Gathitifi ollowaani isa iraa boojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ammalle worra Moabu dabsate, worri isa jalati bule gibira baaseefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba eege, Daudini Hadadezeri hayyu lafa Soba, d'aatu lafa Hamathiti, had'e, wonti akanatiifi Hadadezerini lafa isaa ta fulla galaana Frati deefachu fed'a!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini gaari isaa ka kuma tokotifi askarti isaa ta farda nama kuma torbatifi askarti miilaani yaatu nama kuma diddama qabe, farda gaari hirkisu, ka d'ibba toko gahu, lakise, ka iraa hafe ch'ufa nanaafachise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa worri gosa shamu, ka Damaski jiru, duula baase hayyu Hadadezeri qarqaaru d'aqe, Daudini worra had'e, nama kuma diddami lama fit'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Daudini lafa worra keesati fulla askartini isaa teetu jaare, worri isa jalati bule gibira baaseefi. AABBO Waaqi Daudi fulla inni bahe ch'ufa qarqaare, waan ch'ufa isa dabsachiise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini wonte worqiini mid'aasani, ta jari gugurdaani Hadadezeri yauni, guure Yerusalemuti geese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.40+1KI.7.41+1KI.7.42+1KI.7.43+1KI.7.44+1KI.7.45+1KI.7.46+1KI.7.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Hay 7.40-47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.11+2CH.4.12+2CH.4.13+2CH.4.14+2CH.4.15+2CH.4.16+2CH.4.17+2CH.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Od-dur 4.11-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammalle sibiila diima heddu dira Tibhathitifi Kuni jed'ani, ka Hadadezerini mohatu, keesaa boojie. (Sibiila kana eege Solomonini fuud'e, haro gingitifi, utubafi, miha Mana Waaqatini mid'aase.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Toini, ka lafa Hamathi, aka Daudini askarti lafa Hadadezeri ch'ufa dabsate d'agaye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jennaani ilma isaa Yoramu Dauditi erge, nagaya iti naa himi, atini aka d'iira taate, ka Hadadezeri, nama nu maro heddu woli haane dabsate balleesite jed'iini jed'e. Yoramuni waan worqifi qarsifi sibiila diima mid'aasani Daudi geese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini miha inni d'ufeeni suni eebise, qarsifi worqi inni lafa had'e taani ch'ufa iraa boojie woliini, Ka AABBO Waaqaa jed'e olkaye. Lafti inni had'e dabsate suni tana: Edomu, Moabu, Amoni, Filistifi Amaleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishaini, ilmi Seruya, gosa Edomu bale sooda keesati dabsate, nama kuma kud'ani saddeeti fit'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Edomu keesa fulla ch'ufati, fulla askartini teetu jaare, biyyiti lafa sunileeni ch'ufti hayyu Daudi jalati bulte. AABBO Waaqi Daudi fulla inni bahe ch'ufa eebise, nyaapa isale ch'ufa isa dabsachiise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini worra Israeli ch'ufa aka dansa d'ugaafi qajeelumani fide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabuni, ilmi Seruya, gudda askarti isati; Yehoshefathini, ilmi Ahiludi, nama waan t'aafani ch'ufa harkaa qabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sadoki, ilmi Ahitubutifi Ahimelekini, ilmi Abiathari, qaalole; Serayaani nama hayyu tatabe t'aafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaiyani, ilmi Yehoyada, gudda askarti Daudi eeddu; ammalle ilmaani isaaleeni huji isaa keesa nama gugurda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini worra Amonitifi ka Shamu dabsate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
